  "text": "Here's a function that counts word frequencies ignoring case and punctuation:\n\n```python\nimport string\n\ndef word_histogram(text):\n    text = text.lower()\n    for punc in string.punctuation:\n        text = text.replace(punc, ' ')\n    words = text.split()\n    freq = {}\n    for word in words:\n        freq[word] = freq.get(word, 0) + 1\n    return freq\n```\n\nThis implementation:\n1. Converts the text to lowercase\n2. Replaces all punctuation with spaces\n3. Splits the text into words\n4. Counts the frequency of each word using a dictionary\n\nThe code passes all the provided unit tests.",
